# Uptime Kuma – optional environment variables
#
# Uptime Kuma runs with its own defaults. Use this template if you want to
# standardize timezone/locale across stacks.

# TZ/locale: use shared.env (see documents/SHARED-RESOURCES.md)


# Gotify credentials belong in Kuma notification settings, not this environment.
# Use http://gotify:80 on telemetry and a dedicated application token.
